[{"id":162035861,"discussion_id":"c6a771794c3364e665b991132f56a9a9b88245e2","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| foreach | ✅ [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*fanqirui*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui) (2/2) | ✅ [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-03T09:44:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T10:36:49+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162035871,"discussion_id":"5490c07e69923b82988a00086177f1fe6ecabfdb","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-03T09:44:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-03T09:44:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162035907,"discussion_id":"3c3b840e0b2173b053170aabbd1380ad3d1140a5","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化数据拷贝操作的参数传递方式，提升代码质量。主要解决了原有代码中结构体参数初始化方式冗长、存在隐式类型转换风险的问题，通过重构使其更简洁、类型安全，从而增强了代码的可读性和可维护性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改集中在`CopyIn`和`CopyOut`函数中处理非对齐数据块的逻辑。具体方案是将调用`DataCopyPad`函数时的参数构造方式，从原有的结构体声明后逐字段赋值，重构为直接使用`DataCopyExtParams`和`DataCopyPadExtParams`构造函数的显式初始化列表。这一改动确保了参数类型的显式转换，遵循了现代C++最佳实践，使代码意图更清晰。","created_at":"2026-02-03T09:45:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-03T09:45:12+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162035951,"discussion_id":"64b4761a8ba4fbf274c6ab72f2a9df0e60a9219a","body":"### 代码结构与可维护性: CopyIn和CopyOut函数中，构造DataCopyExtParams和DataCopyPadExtParams的代码存在重复。两个函数都使用了相同的模式来初始化extParams（除了CopyOut不需要padParams），这违反了DRY（Don't Repeat Yourself）原则，增加了维护成本和出错风险。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码结构与可维护性\n**文件路径**: `foreach/foreach_non_finite_check_and_unscale/op_kernel/arch35/foreach_non_finite_check_and_unscale_regbase.h`\n**行号**: 179\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\nDataCopyExtParams extParams{\n            static_cast<uint16_t>(1), static_cast<uint32_t>(dataCount * sizeof(T)), static_cast<uint32_t>(0),\n            static_cast<uint32_t>(0), 0};\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n将DataCopyExtParams的构造逻辑提取为一个辅助函数，例如：DataCopyExtParams MakeDataCopyExtParams(int64_t dataCount, size_t elementSize)。这样可以在CopyIn和CopyOut中调用，确保一致性并减少重复代码。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-02-03T09:45:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-03T09:45:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CA